      "content": "the \"goblin scout\" thing a bit weird lol. anyway, i'm on a bare-metal system so i can't really run valgrind or heavy profilers. i have limited resources. are there ways to implement custom tracking or hooks for malloc/free inside the code itself to see which modules are hogging the heap?",
